      "created_at": "2016-01-26T18:56:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Progeny Flips when a hero character card is less than 10 HP. &nbsp;Does an incapacitated hero count for this (as they are hypothetically a hero character card at 0 HP)? &nbsp;We had a very in depth discussion about interpreting the question and couldn't come to a solid answer, so I'm looking for an official ruling. Thanks!</p>",
